Description: Add .desktop shortcuts of installed deb/snap packages to desktop
 desktop_installer (command: dtier) scans installed deb and snap
 packages, lists their .desktop files, and lets the user add selected
 shortcuts to the desktop with a single click.
 .
 Features:
  * Tabs for deb and snap packages
  * Sortable by name and install time
  * Batch selection and installation
  * Conflict resolution (overwrite / rename / skip)
  * Follows Ubuntu accent color and dark/light mode
  * No sudo required